$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General procedure for the amination reaction
of 3-bromooxindoles with indolines : The mixture of 3-bromooxindole 2
(0.1 mmol), DABCO (0.15 mmol) and catalyst Ni(OAc)2-3e (0.02 mmol) were
added to a solution of indoline 1 (0.12 mmol) in MTBE (1.5 ml), the
resulting solution was then stirred at room temperature. After the
starting material was completely consumed as monitored by TLC, the
mixture was concentrated in vacuo. The crude products was purified by
flash column chromatography (EA/CH2Cl2 = 1:100-1:20) to give product.
(S)-3'-(2-azidoethyl)-6-chloro-[1,3'-biindolin]-2'-one. (4i). Yield 88%,
92% ee. Base: K3PO4, time: 5 h. 1H NMR (300 MHz, DMSO) δ 10.88 (s, 1 H),
7.33 (dd, J = 12.6, 6.6 Hz, 2 H), 7.04 (d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 6.99 (dd, J
= 7.6, 3.9 Hz, 2 H), 6.54 (dd, J = 6.8, 1.8 Hz, 1 H), 5.48 (d, J = 1.8
Hz, 1 H), 4.00 (d, J = 8.9 Hz, 1 H), 3.95-3.83 (m, 1 H), 3.34-3.22 (m, 1
H), 3.16 (dt, J = 12.6, 7.5 Hz, 1 H), 2.90 (dd, J = 8.8, 4.6 Hz, 2 H),
2.45-2.30 (m, 2 H). 13C NMR (75 MHz, DMSO) δ 177.3, 151.0, 141.6, 131.1,
130.0, 129.8, 128.4, 125.3, 124.4, 122.5, 117.5, 110.3, 107.9, 64.5,
50.1, 45.8, 35.6, 26.8. IR: 3412, 2925, 2101, 1469, 1265, 741, 487 cm-1;
[α]25D = -29 (c 1.0, CHCl3). HRMS (ESI): C18H16ClN5O+H, Calc: 354.1116,
Found: 354.1127; HPLC: Chiralcel OD, Hexane/iPrOH = 90/10, flow rate =
1.0 mL/min, retention time: tmajor = 9.3, tminor = 18.8.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, 92% ee
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Construction of the N1-C3 Linkage Stereogenic Centers by Catalytic
Asymmetric Amination Reaction of 3-Bromooxindoles with Indolines
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
